id: advancedRating
name: Advanced Rating
metadata:
  description: Rate scenes and performers across configurable criteria; the overall
    Stash rating is calculated from a weighted average. Configure groups, criteria,
    weights, and descriptions in the plugin settings panel. Replaces the separate
    Advanced Scene Rating and Advanced Performer Rating plugins; existing settings
    are imported automatically on first run.
